Icon rendered (Godot, tools/render_item_icon.gd) from assets/meshes/wood_plank.glb,
stretched (scale 3.6,0.42,1.05) into a wide flat plank silhouette and textured with the
procedural wood-plank albedo so it reads as a wooden plank, not a unit brick.
